summary:
It was Saturday, Moose was having his usual party at his house. But today, he was hanging out with someone that Jughead hadn't seen before."Do you always look like you have no fun?" The boy asked, leaning over the couch next to him. Jughead only barely glanced at him before retreating to what he did before — watching the people."Well, given that you are new here, I probably have to warn you. I'm the weird loser, so you do not want to be seen with me. The only reason why I'm invited is so that I won't write anything bad about them in the school newspaper""I see... What's your name?""Who wants to know?""Oh, right. I'm Reggie, I'm the new student at Riverdale. Me and my mom just moved here last week" Reggie reached him his hand and Jughead got up in order to pull away."Well, I'm going home, bye""At least tell me your name!" He heard behind him."It's fuck off, with two zeros"Not even before he had arrived home, he got a message on Instagram.From none other but @Reggie.Mantle. 
